[center][size=6][color=#93c47d][b]CSS v1.0.0[/b][/color][/size][/center]

[b]Added[/b]
[list]
[*]Facial Expression selection in Customize for supported outfits, with a browsable list, controller cycling and profile saving.
[*]Synchronized facial playback for supported animations on Eve, Unholy Genessa and Commander White.
[/list]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ngodn/CustomShellSystem/e06a567a9201fc688203fef2ceddf3412957c217/docs/media/v1.0.0/unholy-genessa.jpg[/img]

[list]
[*]52 additional idle animations in Locomotion > Idle Animation.
[*]Native-human versions of the shared animation library for compatible original shells.
[/list]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ngodn/CustomShellSystem/1f777697ad6fb93f9cfbcf4867fa677cd7ea0eca/docs/media/v1.0.0/shared-animations.jpg[/img]

[list]
[*]Merrick, Tarsus, Droeg, the Nameless Captive and Sir Isaac appearances in Use NPC / Enemy. The adapted bosses are roughly player-sized and keep normal weapon sizes.
[/list]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ngodn/CustomShellSystem/1f777697ad6fb93f9cfbcf4867fa677cd7ea0eca/docs/media/v1.0.0/npc-merrick.jpg[/img]

[list]
[*]Sixteen native shades across eight original shells, using the game's unlock requirements. Choose shade opens a controller-navigable list. Profiles remember your selected shade.
[/list]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ngodn/CustomShellSystem/e06a567a9201fc688203fef2ceddf3412957c217/docs/media/v1.0.0/shell-shades.jpg[/img]

[list]
[*]Optional Faithful override in MISC when Alteration blocks revival. Confirm or cancel before switching. Purchased upgrades and progression stay intact; the game can save the resulting form and health normally.
[/list]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ngodn/CustomShellSystem/e06a567a9201fc688203fef2ceddf3412957c217/docs/media/v1.0.0/faithful-override.jpg[/img]

[list]
[*]Sunlight shadows in MISC: keep Default (game), or choose Reduced noise to reduce moving shadow speckles. This optional workaround makes sunlight shadows sharper across the scene. Default (game) remains the default.
[/list]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ngodn/CustomShellSystem/a62224b36ed5c33fcc55d0907a52ab6cb0cd6400/docs/media/v1.0.0/sunlight-shadows.jpg[/img]

[b]Fixes and improvements[/b]
[list]
[*]Fixed hidden sidearms leaving attached Tarstone effects visible. Infusions stay active, and fired projectiles remain visible.
[*]Fixed the extra axe hovering above the Trebuchaxe while aiming.
[*]Fixed profiles retaining visibility overrides when the saved choice was Default.
[*]Fixed mirrored profiles using a different outfit choice, and added missing-outfit checks before applying a profile.
[*]Fixed customization disappearing after a Genessa form change.
[*]Removed the 128-attachment snapshot limit that could block appearance restoration.
[/list]

[b]CSS Shared Assets[/b]
The separate CSS Shared Assets download now combines the shared animation, facial and doubles resources, including the new boss assets and Peony support. It also contains native-human versions of the existing animation library. Update it together with CSS and your outfit mods.

Close the game before updating. Replace the old CSS runtime and shared-assets package, keeping your CustomShellSystem/state folder and profiles. Remove the superseded CSS_AstralSharedAssets_P and CSS_LocomotionSharedAssets_P packages when installing the combined CSS_SharedAssets_P package.

Zhirelle and boss forms that need further reconstruction are deferred to v1.0.1.
